 ### [Albedo Reconstruction](14422-albedo-reconstruction.md)
-Albedo Reconstruction is a method within volume reconstruction via linear system inversion that optimizes the diffuse albedo field of a volume so that its rendered output matches target images. It isolates the albedo parameter by assuming single scattering, thereby decoupling it from the emission and extinction terms to form a linear system. Unlike joint optimization methods that solve for multiple properties simultaneously, this approach treats albedo as the sole unknown coefficient vector, reducing ambiguity in scenes where emission and reflected light are otherwise coupled.
